{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Issue 464: Water Runes makes every Hurricane strike apply the active Water or Ice engraving",
  "contract": [
    "Water Runes 707150 (Riftblade passive) reads 'Each strike from Hurricane is now guaranteed to apply Weapon",
    "Engraving: Water or Weapon Engraving: Ice to your target while they are active.' Effect 1 is aura 42 triggering",
    "Weapon Engraving: Water 653261 (mana drain), effect 2 aura 42 triggering Weapon Engraving: Ice 653217 (Frost",
    "damage); ProcChance 100. The engravings are active through their weapon enchant equip auras: Water Engraving",
    "653214 (enchant 1001) and Ice Engraving 653266 (enchant 1004). The record's ProcFlags 4 (done melee auto attack)",
    "made SpellMgr generate a proc that fired both effects on every auto-attack hit, with or without an engraving,",
    "while Hurricane strikes (645437, a triggered melee-class spell) never applied anything. Expected: auto-attacks",
    "apply nothing; each landed Hurricane strike casts 653217 while Ice Engraving is active and 653261 while Water",
    "Engraving is active, one cast per strike, named as triggered by Water Runes; with no engraving nothing. The",
    "target is Stonard Shaman 868 because the mana drain is rejected on a target without mana."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 150000,
  "location": {"map": 0, "x": -8949.95, "y": -132.493, "z": 83.5312, "o": 0},
  "players": [
    {"id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "melee_hit_rating": 10000, "expertise_rating": 10000,
      "spell_hit_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "shaman", "owner": "rm", "entry": 868, "level": 80, "health": 1000000, "distance": 3}
